01357: # NOTE: Maranga Berry supposedly shouldn't trigger if the user has Sheer Force,
01358: #       but I'm ignoring this. Weakness Policy has the same kind of effect and
01359: #       nowhere says it should be stopped by Sheer Force. I suspect this
01360: #       stoppage is either a false report that no one ever corrected, or an
01361: #       effect that later changed and wasn't noticed.
01362: Battle::ItemEffects::OnBeingHit.add(:MARANGABERRY,
01363:   proc { |item, user, target, move, battle|
01364:     next if !move.specialMove?
01365:     if Battle::ItemEffects.triggerOnBeingHitPositiveBerry(item, target, battle, false)
01366:       target.pbHeldItemTriggered(item)
